{"html":"<p>Every \"just use a channel\" queue loses work the moment the process dies. This\nproject builds the real thing: a durable queue with at-least-once delivery,\nidempotent handlers, retries with backoff and a reaper that rescues jobs from dead\nworkers.</p>\n<p><strong>What it is:</strong> a library plus a worker binary. <code>enqueue(&#x26;pool, job)</code> inside a\ntransaction; <code>Worker::run()</code> claims with <code>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-learn\">What you learn</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Skill</th>\n<th>Where it comes from</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Transactional correctness</td>\n<td>enqueue-in-same-transaction, no dual writes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Concurrent SQL</td>\n<td><code>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code>, index-only claim</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Failure design</td>\n<td>retries, poison messages, dead-letter, idempotency</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Observability</td>\n<td>per-job spans, queue depth metric, stuck-queue alert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Graceful shutdown</td>\n<td>finish in-flight, release locks, drain</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"milestones\">Milestones</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Ship</th>\n<th>Done when</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Table + claim</td>\n<td>two workers never take the same row</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Complete / fail</td>\n<td>failures retry with growing delay</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Idempotency</td>\n<td>running the same job twice changes state once</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Reaper</td>\n<td>a killed worker's jobs return to <code>pending</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Metrics</td>\n<td>depth, age of oldest pending, failure rate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Shutdown</td>\n<td>SIGTERM finishes the current job, then exits</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"the-claim-query\">The claim query</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"sql\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"sql\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> jobs </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SET</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    status</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'running'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    attempts </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> attempts </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">+</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    locked_at </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> now</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(),</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    locked_by </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> $</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">IN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> (</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> jobs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> status</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> AND</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> run_at </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> now</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">()</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    ORDER BY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> run_at</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    FOR</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> SKIP</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> LOCKED</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    LIMIT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> $</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">RETURNING id, kind, payload, attempts;</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><code>SKIP LOCKED</code> is the whole trick: a second worker does not block, it moves on to\nthe next row. Without it, every worker serialises behind the first.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-worker-loop-with-shutdown\">The worker loop, with shutdown</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">use</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> tokio</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">watch;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">use</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> tracing</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Instrument</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> async</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> fn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(pool</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> PgPool</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shik