/li>\n<li>Batch handlers: claim 100 rows, one transaction.</li>\n<li>Swap the backend behind a <code>Queue</code> trait and add an SQS implementation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"demo-checklist\">Demo checklist</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> kill -9 a worker mid-job; the reaper returns its jobs</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> the same job key run twice produces one effect</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> SIGTERM exits cleanly with the current job completed</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> a graph of queue depth during a 10k-job burst</li>\n</ul>"}